---
// Card extension for slot="extra" (astrobase.md §3.2/§4): quantity selector
// wired to the EXISTING quantity-control contract ([data-qty-step] /
// [data-qty-value], floor 1, scoped per card via utils/dom closestCard) plus
// the "Agregar al carrito" trigger handled by islands/cart-actions.ts.
// Lives in ui/ so smart/ never owns buttons (astrobase.md §3.3). Never
// fetches — ui/ rule (astrobase.md §1).
---
<div class="mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
	<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
		<button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-qty-step="down" aria-label="Restar cantidad">
			−
		</button>
		<span data-qty-value class="text-lg font-semibold text-text">1</span>
		<button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-qty-step="up" aria-label="Sumar cantidad">
			+
		</button>
	</div>
	<button type="button" class="btn btn-primary flex-1" data-add-to-cart>Agregar al carrito</button>
</div>
